sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Server as NeMo Guardrails Server<br/>FastAPI<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant Library as Guardrails Library<br/>Action Framework
    participant Actions as Actions Server<br/>FastAPI<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant Jailbreak as Jailbreak Detection<br/>Server
    participant AlignScore as AlignScore Server
    participant OpenAI as OpenAI API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Azure as Azure OpenAI<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant ActiveFence as ActiveFence API<br/>HTTPS
    participant AIDef as Cisco AI Defense<br/>HTTPS
    participant AutoAlign as AutoAlign API<br/>HTTPS
    participant Clavata as Clavata API<br/>HTTPS

    Note over Client,Server: Chat/Completion Flow
    Client->>Server: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Auth: Bearer Token / API Key
    Server->>Library: Evaluate input rails
    Library->>Jailbreak: POST /heuristics<br/>Jailbreak check
    Jailbreak-->>Library: Jailbreak result
    Library->>AlignScore: POST /alignscore_base<br/>Fact-checking
    AlignScore-->>Library: Alignment score

    alt ActiveFence enabled
        Library->>ActiveFence: POST /sync/v3/content/text<br/>Auth: API Key (ACTIVEFENCE_API_KEY)
        ActiveFence-->>Library: Content moderation result
    end

    alt Cisco AI Defense enabled
        Library->>AIDef: POST (configured endpoint)<br/>Auth: API Key (AI_DEFENSE_API_KEY)
        Note over Library,AIDef: Supports fail_open/fail_closed config
        AIDef-->>Library: Defense check result
    end

    alt AutoAlign enabled
        Library->>AutoAlign: POST (configured endpoint)<br/>Auth: API Key (AUTOALIGN_API_KEY)
        AutoAlign-->>Library: Alignment result
    end

    alt Clavata enabled
        Library->>Clavata: POST /v1/jobs<br/>Auth: API Key (CLAVATA_API_KEY)
        Note over Library,Clavata: Exponential backoff on HTTP 429
        Clavata-->>Library: Content check result
    end

    Library-->>Server: Rails evaluation complete

    alt Using OpenAI
        Server->>OpenAI: LLM inference request<br/>Auth: API Key (OpenAI SDK)
        OpenAI-->>Server: LLM response
    else Using Azure OpenAI
        Server->>Azure: LLM inference request<br/>Auth: API Key (AZURE_OPENAI_API_KEY)
        Azure-->>Server: LLM response
    end

    Server->>Library: Evaluate output rails
    Library-->>Server: Output rails result
    Server-->>Client: JSON Response

    Note over Client,Actions: Remote Action Execution Flow
    Client->>Actions: POST /v1/actions/run<br/>Auth: None observed
    Actions-->>Client: Action result

    Client->>Actions: GET /v1/actions/list<br/>Auth: None observed
    Actions-->>Client: Available actions list

    Note over Client,Server: Health Check Flow
    Client->>Server: GET /v1/health
    Server-->>Client: Health status
    Client->>Server: GET /healthz
    Server-->>Client: Health status
